WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Crouching medium punch starts at the wall.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.100
Rush forward heavy kick begins the corner juggle.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.900
Light Torbalan extends the airborne sequence.

4
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.400
A second forward heavy kick catches the projectile juggle.

5
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.000
Standing heavy punch follows medium Stribog.

6
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.400
Heavy Triglav finishes the damage sequence.

7
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.750
OD Departure establishes the two-portal corner state.
